# BandsChamber Studio — docs sync (Cursor)

Follow the repo agent rules in `AGENTS.md` and the full protocol in
`docs/AGENT_PROTOCOL.md`:

- Read `docs/README.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/REQUIREMENTS.md`,
  `docs/ACCEPTANCE.md` before editing code.
- Every behavior/API/DB-schema/access change updates `docs/` in the same
  change. Append FR/NFR numbers, never renumber.
- UI strings require all 5 i18n locales (`src/lib/i18n/`).
- New pages/API routes must enforce auth/access (no middleware exists).
- Verify with `npx tsc --noEmit` + `npm test` (`npm run build` for UI/API).
